WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,180 --> 00:00:06,600
Okay, I've solved a big problem for you. Let's go.

2
00:00:07,310 --> 00:00:10,300
There is no need to change your mind about my great kindness.

3
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:13,780
Grand Master Arn, I will never forget your great master from university.

4
00:00:13,780 --> 00:00:15,540
treacherous traitor

5
00:00:15,780 --> 00:00:20,280
Things will change, sooner or later you will have to crawl back like dogs and beg me to take care of you

6
00:00:20,280 --> 00:00:23,220
No door

7
00:00:23,220 --> 00:00:25,720
I want to stay too, is that okay?

8
00:00:25,720 --> 00:00:32,900
Wait a moment

9
00:00:32,900 --> 00:00:34,400
Don't push yourself too far

10
00:00:34,400 --> 00:00:38,720
Your bodyguards have been poached by you, what else do you want to do?

11
00:00:38,720 --> 00:00:40,220
I forgive you

12
00:00:40,220 --> 00:00:42,220
But my little brother hasn’t forgiven you yet

13
00:00:42,220 --> 00:00:43,910
apologize to him

14
00:00:44,210 --> 00:00:45,710
When will he forgive you?

15
00:00:45,710 --> 00:00:47,710
When can you leave?
